title: Wire PreToolUse into execute_tools
updated_at: "2026-08-02T04:22:52Z"
---
In agent_2_tools.ml execute_tools, before executing each tool call, fire PreToolUse hooks. If hook blocks (exit 2 or decision:deny), skip tool execution and return block reason to agent. Support updatedInput to modify parameters. Fire for all tool types including MCP.